     @click.option("--format", multiple=True, default=["json"])
 
+Flags also support ``multiple=True``, including boolean flags and custom
+``flag_value`` options. Each occurrence adds its value to the result tuple
+in command line order. Without an explicit default, omitting the flags
+produces an empty tuple.
